  "description": "Agent-to-agent protocol over Aether mesh transport for Circle AI —\n      one person's AI talks to another person's AI directly over BLE/Wi-Fi\n      Direct, no cloud. 1.4.0 adds AgentMessage.CorrelationId — distributed-\n      trace anchor (wire equivalent of HTTP X-Correlation-ID) for stitching\n      multi-hop agent exchanges. AgentMessage.Create synthesises a 32-char\n      Guid \"N\" form when the caller doesn't supply one, so every outbound\n      envelope carries SOME trace ID.",
